/packs/
/.vscode/
/.claude/
# The seven top-level spec/decision documents are PUBLISHED (2026-08-16, +
# SELF-HOSTING 2026-09-23): they are the format contract CLAUDE.md,
# backend/CLAUDE.md and delta_test.go cite as mandatory pre-reading, plus the
# self-hosting deployment guide. Everything else under /docs/ — findings,
# superpowers plans/specs — stays local-only working material (see CLAUDE.md's
# store-visibility reasoning for why internal planning does not get published).
/docs/*
!/docs/MANIFEST-SPEC.md
!/docs/MULTI-STORE-SPEC.md
!/docs/DELTA-TAIL-SPEC.md
!/docs/INBOX-SPEC.md
!/docs/STORE-VISIBILITY.md
!/docs/STATIC-ENGINE-DECISION.md
!/docs/SELF-HOSTING.md
/FINDINGS-PLAN.md

# Frontend
/frontend/node_modules/
/frontend/.parcel-cache/
/frontend/dist/
/dist/

# design-sync build output (regenerable; see .design-sync/NOTES.md)
/ds-bundle/
.worktrees/
.superpowers/
